        ><p\n            >Acme Summit brings together the people who build the tools teams use every day. Two days, one track, no\n            sponsor pitches - just honest talks on making software calmer, and workshops where you leave with something\n            built.</p\n          ></section\n        >\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"ed-who\"\n          ><h2 id=\"ed-who\" data-i18n-target=\"ev-13-1\">Who it is for</h2>\n          <ul class=\"mk-event-description-audience\"\n            ><li><i data-lucide=\"lightbulb\"></i><span data-i18n-target=\"ev-14-1\">Product managers</span></li\n            ><li><i data-lucide=\"pen-tool\"></i><span data-i18n-target=\"ev-15-1\">Designers</span></li\n            ><li><i data-lucide=\"code\"></i><span data-i18n-target=\"ev-16-1\">Engineers</span></li\n            ><li><i data-lucide=\"users\"></i><span data-i18n-target=\"ev-17-1\">Team leads</span></li></ul\n          >\n        </section>\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"ed-take\"\n          ><h2 id=\"ed-take\" data-i18n-target=\"ev-18-1\">What you will take away</h2>\n          <ul class=\"mk-event-description-takeaways\"\n            ><li><i data-lucide=\"check\"></i><span data-i18n-target=\"ev-19-1\">A playbook for async planning</span></li\n            ><li\n              ><i data-lucide=\"check\"></i><span data-i18n-target=\"ev-20-1\">Patterns for quiet, accessible UI</span></li\n            ><li\n              ><i data-lucide=\"check\"></i\n              ><span data-i18n-target=\"ev-21-1\">How offline-first sync really works</span></li\n            ><li><i data-lucide=\"check\"></i><span data-i18n-target=\"ev-22-1\">Fifty new colleagues to ask</span></li></ul\n          >\n        </section>\n      </div>\n      <aside class=\"mk-event-description-facts\" aria-label=\"Event facts\">\n        <dl>\n          <div><dt data-i18n-target=\"ev-23-1\">Date</dt><dd>12–13 Nov 2026</dd></div>\n          <div><dt>Format</dt><dd data-i18n-target=\"ev-27-1\">In person + str